# Wiki surfaces (check, search, list) ignore these repo-relative paths.
# Patterns are anchored at the repo root and follow gitignore(5) syntax.

# Test fixtures: intentionally-broken wiki pages and dangling fragment links
# used by the CLI's integration tests. They are not real documentation and must
# not surface in `wiki check`/`search`/`list`.
packages/cli/tests/fixtures/

# Generated skill trees. `agent-skills build` renders skills-src/ into every
# platform target below, so each page here exists five times over; indexing them
# would report a title collision per page and, worse, invite `wiki check --fix`
# to rewrite output that the next build discards. The authored source lives in
# skills-src/ as .md.eta, which is not a .md and so is never indexed.
plugins-claude/wiki/skills/
plugins-codex/wiki/skills/
plugins-opencode/wiki/skills/
plugins-antigravity/wiki/skills/
skills/
.agents/skills/
